    "Comment": "Hustle: once per battle, only on the caster's own first turn, move up to the distance to the farthest other party member, free of AP and MP (RTO-T109). The mod's assembly gates it to the first turn (Hustle.cs) and sets its range dynamically (RuleCalculateAbilityRange postfix).",
